        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WORDSCOOP! With Gelato the Otter</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797690/extras/7623a2d59f45279e2241547ce6810385.poster.avif?t=1754586704\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797690/extras/7623a2d59f45279e2241547ce6810385.webm?t=1754586704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797690/extras/7623a2d59f45279e2241547ce6810385.mp4?t=1754586704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gelato needs your help, cadet! To keep their intergalactic ice-cream truck running, they need to harness the power of the mystical SPACE RUNES that float throughout the cosmos. Luckily, these runes prefer to bind themselves to frozen desserts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797690/extras/d9c22335d9f46ce0596ef810d7ba50d8.avif?t=1754586704\" width=348 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, these runes are fickle, and their magic only works when they are used to spell words from an arcane language known by some as &quot;English.&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797690/extras/2d32684d03af336ede074f275f075897.avif?t=1754586704\" width=255 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's where you come in! Though Gelato is great at speaking their native language (Intergalactic Standard Mammal,) they only know a few English words. As their cadet, it's up to you to use your lexicon to find the words hidden among the scoops!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797690/extras/056b501d60c6d354cfc906d63dcaebc8.poster.avif?t=1754586704\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797690/extras/056b501d60c6d354cfc906d63dcaebc8.webm?t=1754586704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797690/extras/056b501d60c6d354cfc906d63dcaebc8.mp4?t=1754586704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay of <i>WordScoop</i> is simple! You are given a matrix of ice cream scoops, each with a letter on them. Your goal is to find words by connecting adjacent scoops! You can go in any direction you want, but they have to be contiguous. When the word is ready, click again on the last scoop to submit it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797690/extras/611a9e57e490b88f11d2e168d6512323.poster.avif?t=1754586704\" width=242 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797690/extras/611a9e57e490b88f11d2e168d6512323.webm?t=1754586704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797690/extras/611a9e57e490b88f11d2e168d6512323.mp4?t=1754586704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you spell longer words, bonus sprinkles will appear on existing scoops! Submitting a word with these will apply a multiplier to the points you earn from it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797690/extras/dc1e9e90b398f0a7449e0a077159bbae.poster.avif?t=1754586704\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797690/extras/dc1e9e90b398f0a7449e0a077159bbae.webm?t=1754586704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797690/extras/dc1e9e90b398f0a7449e0a077159bbae.mp4?t=1754586704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful, however! Relying too much on short words will cause more VOID scoops to spawn. These greedy creatures love eating both RUNES and ice cream, so you can bet that they're trouble! They appear at the top of the screen and gradually eat their way down, so make sure they don't hit the bottom. Otherwise, it's game over. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle Mode:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797690/extras/2c94e304580c2aff710d45c2e8f21b2d.poster.avif?t=1754586704\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797690/extras/2c94e304580c2aff710d45c2e8f21b2d.webm?t=1754586704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797690/extras/2c94e304580c2aff710d45c2e8f21b2d.mp4?t=1754586704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game moves when you do! Every time you submit a word, new VOID scoops have a chance of spawning, and existing ones burn the scoop below them, making their way to the bottom. Take your time and plan ahead to make sure that doesn't happen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cascade Mode:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797690/extras/ba5fe9930212a63e0b0975089a75ae43.poster.avif?t=1754586704\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797690/extras/ba5fe9930212a63e0b0975089a75ae43.webm?t=1754586704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797690/extras/ba5fe9930212a63e0b0975089a75ae43.mp4?t=1754586704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The game moves without you! VOIDs spawn on their own, and work their way to the bottom of the screen on a timer. Stay on your toes to keep the game rolling! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Timed Mode:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797690/extras/c0dbfe061603b036092e271c499e6dcb.poster.avif?t=1754586704\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797690/extras/c0dbfe061603b036092e271c499e6dcb.webm?t=1754586704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797690/extras/c0dbfe061603b036092e271c499e6dcb.mp4?t=1754586704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VOIDs aren't a problem, but only for a few minutes! How many words can you spell in the time allotted? Make sure to rack up as many bonus sprinkles as you can!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chill Mode:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797690/extras/04f02221d91f2832c66a9a0de7469716.poster.avif?t=1754586704\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797690/extras/04f02221d91f2832c66a9a0de7469716.webm?t=1754586704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797690/extras/04f02221d91f2832c66a9a0de7469716.mp4?t=1754586704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice your word-searching techniques! VOIDs don't spawn, but neither do bonus sprinkles. This mode does not keep score, so don't sweat it! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dictionary:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797690/extras/0eab530f852af9b2a778de80d0f7b70e.avif?t=1754586704\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not sure what word is/isn't allowed? Want a definition to prove that it's a real word? Use the in-game dictionary screen to double-check! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Options Menu: </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797690/extras/57d9ced00795881fed0a30457a1c7f1b.avif?t=1754586704\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the sake of accessibility, WordScoop features a screen that allows you to enable/disable sound, music, and unnecessary motion effects such as particles, screen-wipes, and scrolling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Scores:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797690/extras/558a6815d7d1490e9c4cf8e0dabd26e4.avif?t=1754586704\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What fun would arcade game be without keeping score? Upon game over, you'll be asked to enter your name to be placed on the leaderboard. Each mode has its own table (except Chill, of course.) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Content Warning:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Wordscoop uses a publicly available dictionary. Though WordScoop is an all-ages game and every effort has been made to remove offensive/unsavory terms, some may still exist in the game files, and may be adjusted or removed with updates. Some words that may be only considered offensive in certain contexts, such as medical/anatomical terms, have been left in the game.</i></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WORDSCOOP! With Gelato the Otter</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797690/extras/7623a2d59f45279e2241547ce6810385.poster.avif?t=1754586704\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797690/extras/7623a2d59f45279e2241547ce6810385.webm?t=1754586704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797690/extras/7623a2d59f45279e2241547ce6810385.mp4?t=1754586704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gelato needs your help, cadet! To keep their intergalactic ice-cream truck running, they need to harness the power of the mystical SPACE RUNES that float throughout the cosmos. Luckily, these runes prefer to bind themselves to frozen desserts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797690/extras/d9c22335d9f46ce0596ef810d7ba50d8.avif?t=1754586704\" width=348 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, these runes are fickle, and their magic only works when they are used to spell words from an arcane language known by some as &quot;English.&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797690/extras/2d32684d03af336ede074f275f075897.avif?t=1754586704\" width=255 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's where you come in! Though Gelato is great at speaking their native language (Intergalactic Standard Mammal,) they only know a few English words. As their cadet, it's up to you to use your lexicon to find the words hidden among the scoops!</p><h2 clas