ras/04f02221d91f2832c66a9a0de7469716.poster.avif?t=1754586704\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797690/extras/04f02221d91f2832c66a9a0de7469716.webm?t=1754586704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797690/extras/04f02221d91f2832c66a9a0de7469716.mp4?t=1754586704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice your word-searching techniques! VOIDs don't spawn, but neither do bonus sprinkles. This mode does not keep score, so don't sweat it! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dictionary:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797690/extras/0eab530f852af9b2a778de80d0f7b70e.avif?t=1754586704\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not sure what word is/isn't allowed? Want a definition to prove that it's a real word? Use the in-game dictionary screen to double-check! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Options Menu: </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797690/extras/57d9ced00795881fed0a30457a1c7f1b.avif?t=1754586704\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the sake of accessibility, WordScoop features a screen that allows you to enable/disable sound, music, and unnecessary motion effects such as particles, screen-wipes, and scrolling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Scores:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797690/extras/558a6815d7d1490e9c4cf8e0dabd26e4.avif?t=1754586704\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What fun would arcade game be without keeping score? Upon game over, you'll be asked to enter your name to be placed on the leaderboard. Each mode has its own table (except Chill, of course.) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Content Warning:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Wordscoop uses a publicly available dictionary. Though WordScoop is an all-ages game and every effort has been made to remove offensive/unsavory terms, some may still exist in the game files, and may be adjusted or removed with updates. Some words that may be only considered offensive in certain contexts, such as medical/anatomical terms, have been left in the game.</i></p>",
